<v Griffin Hansbury>[BOTH LAUGH]
<v Griffin Hansbury>[两人大笑]

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:38.800
<v Julie Snyder>And then Alex's final question, when they talk-- you know, when Alex is, um--
<v Julie Snyder>然后是亚历克斯的最后一个问题，当他们谈论……你知道，当亚历克斯……

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:44.440
<v Ira Glass>I know exactly. I know it so well because it's one of my favorite ever posed on our show.
